/* Capture presentation only. No persisted values or decisions are translated. */
"拍攝傷口" = "Photograph wound";
"重新拍攝" = "Retake photo";
"影像處理中…" = "Processing photo…";
"⚠ 這張照片沒有取得 LiDAR 深度，無法量測。請重拍（勿遮擋鏡頭旁的 LiDAR 感測器）。" = "⚠ This photo has no LiDAR depth, so an area cannot be estimated. Retake the photo and keep the LiDAR sensor beside the camera unobstructed.";
"照片、深度或相機校正資料無法對應，未送出辨識或計算。請重新拍攝。" = "The photo, depth or camera calibration could not be matched. No analysis or calculation was started. Please retake the photo.";
"照片與原始深度已保存在手機，尚未傳送。可選擇個人雲端辨識，或自行圈選後存入紀錄。" = "The photo and original depth are saved on this device and have not been sent. Choose personal cloud analysis, or draw an outline yourself and save the record.";
"照片與深度尚未完整保存，未送出辨識。請保留此畫面並重試保存。" = "The photo and depth have not been fully saved, and analysis has not been sent. Keep this screen open and retry saving.";
"本地辨識中…" = "Analyzing on this device…";
"已由裝置端模型自動圈選（未連網）。可用「修正圈選」微調。" = "An on-device model created the outline without a network connection. Use Edit outline to adjust it.";
"雲端辨識中…（約數秒）" = "Analyzing in the cloud… (a few seconds)";
"已自動取畫面中央的傷口（偵測到 %@ 處，其餘忽略）。可用「修正圈選」微調。" = "The wound nearest the center was selected from %@ detected regions; the others were excluded. Use Edit outline to adjust it.";
"可於設定停止未來上傳。" = "You can stop future uploads in Settings.";
"雲端未辨識到傷口，請手動圈選。" = "Cloud analysis did not find a wound. Please draw an outline yourself.";
"雲端辨識未成功（連線或服務問題），請手動圈選傷口。" = "Cloud analysis could not complete because of a connection or service problem. Please draw the wound outline yourself.";
"請先完整重讀紀錄，再恢復尚未存入的拍攝；原始檔案保留。" = "Reload all records before resuming an unsaved capture. Original files are retained.";
"有 %@ 筆拍攝尚待核對。請解鎖後點「重新核對本機拍攝」。" = "%@ captures still need checking. Unlock the device and tap Check local captures again.";
"拍攝清單暫時無法核對。請解鎖後重讀；原檔保留。" = "The capture list could not be checked. Unlock the device and reload it. Original files are retained.";
"正在保存照片與深度…" = "Saving photo and depth…";
"照片與原始深度已保存在手機，尚未傳送。" = "The photo and original depth are saved on this device and have not been sent.";
"仍未完成本機保存，未送出照片。請保留此畫面。" = "Local saving is still incomplete. The photo has not been sent. Keep this screen open.";
"正在讀回原拍攝…" = "Reading the original capture…";
"照片、深度與圈選已讀回；辨識回執無法核對，已停止雲端續傳。可繼續自行圈選並存入手機，原回執保留。" = "The photo, depth and outline have been read back. The analysis receipt could not be verified, so cloud continuation has stopped. You can outline and save on this device; the original receipt is retained.";
"已讀回尚未存入紀錄的拍攝；照片、深度與圈選保留，未重新送出辨識。" = "The unfinished capture has been read back. Its photo, depth and outline are retained; analysis was not sent again.";
"原拍攝已讀回；辨識圈選尚未完整保存，可再次套用已保存的結果，不需重新辨識。" = "The original capture has been read back, but its analysis outline has not been fully saved. Apply the saved result again; no new analysis is needed.";
"無法完整核對這筆拍攝，未取代目前畫面或送出資料。原檔保留。" = "This capture could not be fully verified. The current screen was not replaced and no data was sent. Original files are retained.";
"這次拍攝已捨棄或紀錄尚待核對，未再送出辨識。" = "This capture was discarded or its record still needs checking. Analysis was not sent again.";
"正在核對個人雲端辨識…" = "Checking personal cloud analysis…";
"尚未確認辨識結果；照片與深度已保存在手機。請核對服務登入，再續接同一筆。" = "Analysis is not yet confirmed. The photo and depth are saved on this device. Check service sign-in, then resume this same capture.";
"未找到可用圈選；照片與深度已保留，可自行圈選。" = "No usable outline was found. The photo and depth are retained; you can draw an outline yourself.";
"已套用個人服務圈選。請確認邊界後存入紀錄；這次辨識不代表同意研究或已上傳研究資料。" = "The personal-service outline has been applied. Check the boundary before saving. This analysis does not imply research consent or a research upload.";
"正在套用已保存的辨識結果…" = "Applying the saved analysis result…";
"辨識結果與原拍攝無法核對，未取代圈選。" = "The analysis result could not be matched to the original capture. The outline was not replaced.";
"量測已存入紀錄，拍攝草稿的結案標記尚待核對。原檔保留。" = "The measurement was saved, but the capture draft's completion status still needs checking. Original files are retained.";
"這次拍攝已捨棄或紀錄尚待核對，未重新存入。" = "This capture was discarded or its record still needs checking. It was not saved again.";
"這次拍攝已存入紀錄，請從紀錄頁繼續；未建立重複資料。" = "This capture is already saved. Continue from Records; no duplicate was created.";
"照片與深度尚未完整存入紀錄，請保留此畫面並重試存檔。" = "The photo and depth have not been fully saved to the record. Keep this screen open and retry saving.";
"紀錄尚未確認存入；照片與深度保留，未清空量測。" = "Saving is not yet confirmed. The photo and depth are retained, and the measurement screen has not been cleared.";
"正在捨棄本機拍攝…" = "Discarding the local capture…";
"已捨棄這次拍攝草稿；服務回執保留，未更動研究同意。" = "This capture draft was discarded. Service receipts are retained and research consent was not changed.";
"捨棄要求已保存，但本機檔案尚未確認清理完成；已停止此筆續傳，請重試捨棄。" = "The discard request was saved, but local file cleanup is not yet confirmed. Continuation has stopped for this capture. Retry discarding it.";
"正在保存圈選…" = "Saving outline…";
"請先完成照片與深度的本機保存，再修正圈選。" = "Finish saving the photo and depth locally before editing the outline.";
"修改尚未保存，已保留上次圈選；請核對儲存空間後再試。" = "The changes were not saved. The previous outline is retained. Check available storage and try again.";
"圈選含多個分離區塊，已取最靠近畫面中央的一塊。" = "The outline contains separate regions. The one nearest the center was selected.";
"深度幾何計算中…" = "Calculating depth geometry…";
"本機已保存；正在核對同步狀態…" = "Saved on this device; checking sync status…";
"僅更新此裝置；研究上傳未開啟。" = "Only this device was updated. Research upload is off.";
"研究同意已變更，此張保留在手機，請手動圈選。" = "Research consent changed. This photo stays on the device; please draw an outline yourself.";
"辨識回傳的影像尺寸或輪廓與原照片不符，未套用結果。請在原照片手動圈選；這不代表先前送出的影像已撤回。" = "The returned dimensions or outline do not match the original photo, so the result was not applied. Outline the original photo yourself. This does not mean a previously sent photo has been withdrawn.";
"正對傷口、距離 25–40 公分，等中央對焦框變綠再拍。" = "Face the wound directly from 25–40 cm away. Wait for the central focus frame to turn green before taking the photo.";
"個人服務登入" = "Personal service sign-in";
"繼續尚未存入的拍攝（%@）" = "Resume unfinished captures (%@)";
"繼續圈選或辨識" = "Resume outlining or analysis";
"捨棄這次拍攝" = "Discard this capture";
"重新核對本機拍攝" = "Check local captures again";
"圈選傷口" = "Outline wound";
"修正圈選" = "Edit outline";
"重新拍攝？" = "Retake the photo?";
"保留目前量測" = "Keep current measurement";
"目前量測尚未存入紀錄。拍下新照片後會取代這個畫面；已存入的紀錄不受影響。取消相機可回到目前量測。" = "This measurement has not been saved. Taking a new photo replaces this screen; saved records are retained. Cancel the camera to return to this measurement.";
"捨棄尚未存入的拍攝？" = "Discard this unfinished capture?";
"捨棄草稿照片與深度" = "Discard draft photo and depth";
"保留" = "Keep";
"此操作無法復原，不退還已使用的辨識額度，也不會撤回已傳送的研究資料。服務回執仍保留供核對。" = "This cannot be undone. Used analysis allowance is not refunded, and research data already sent is not withdrawn. Service receipts remain available for verification.";
"以辨識結果取代目前圈選？" = "Replace this outline with the analysis result?";
"保留目前圈選" = "Keep current outline";
"套用已保存的辨識結果" = "Apply saved analysis result";
"這會取代這次拍攝尚未存入紀錄的圈選，不會重新辨識或使用額度。" = "This replaces the unsaved outline for this capture. It does not run analysis again or use allowance.";
"確認傷口位置" = "Confirm wound location";
"返回修改" = "Go back and edit";
"確認並存入" = "Confirm and save";
"請正對傷口、距離 25–40 公分，框變綠再拍。畫面只拍傷口部位，避免臉部或可辨識個人的物品入鏡。" = "Face the wound directly from 25–40 cm away and wait for the frame to turn green. Include only the wound area; keep faces and identifying items out of the photo.";
"重試保存這次拍攝" = "Retry saving this capture";
"個人雲端辨識會傳送這張照片並核對免費／訂閱額度；研究上傳另需同意。也可直接自行圈選。" = "Personal cloud analysis sends this photo and checks your free or subscription allowance. Research upload requires separate consent. You can also draw an outline yourself.";
"辨識回執無法核對，暫停雲端處理；仍可保存本機圈選。" = "The analysis receipt could not be verified. Cloud processing is paused; you can still save a local outline.";
"套用已保存的辨識圈選" = "Apply saved analysis outline";
"預留已逾時：重新送出" = "Reservation expired: submit again";
"使用個人雲端辨識" = "Use personal cloud analysis";
"續接這次辨識（不重建工作）" = "Resume this analysis (same operation)";
"選擇已紀錄傷口" = "Select an existing wound";
"新增紀錄傷口＋" = "Add a wound +";
"沿用此傷口的位置，不需重填。" = "This wound's saved location will be used. No need to enter it again.";
"側別與詳細部位皆為必填。" = "Side and specific location are both required.";
"此傷口的位置尚未齊全；補填會套用到同組舊紀錄。" = "This wound's location is incomplete. Completing it also updates earlier records in the same group.";
"請選擇已紀錄傷口，或點右側「新增紀錄傷口＋」。" = "Select an existing wound, or tap Add a wound + on the right.";
"核對帳戶正在追蹤的傷口" = "Check this account's tracked wounds";
"目前使用本機免費追蹤。" = "Using free local tracking.";
"追蹤同一處傷口時，請選擇原有傷口；不同傷口的紀錄會分開顯示。" = "Select the existing wound to continue tracking it. Records for different wounds are shown separately.";
"存入紀錄" = "Save record";
"✓ 已存入紀錄" = "✓ Record saved";
"傷口或位置已變更，請重新確認後存入。" = "The wound or location changed. Confirm it again before saving.";
"（LiDAR 輔助表面積估算，僅供個人紀錄參考）" = "(LiDAR-assisted surface area estimate for personal records only)";
"相機方向投影估算 %@ cm²・攝距 %@ cm・深度覆蓋 %@%%" = "Camera-direction projected area estimate: %@ cm² · Distance: %@ cm · Depth coverage: %@%%";
"免貼紙深度估算；投影面積與表面積不同。深度覆蓋完整也不代表小凹凸已量準。" = "Estimated from depth without a sticker. Projected area and surface area differ. Complete depth coverage does not establish accuracy for small surface changes.";
"這次拍攝品質不足，未計算面積" = "Capture quality is insufficient; area was not calculated";
"健康參考工具，非醫療診斷。傷口惡化、發燒或大量滲液請就醫。" = "A personal health reference tool, not a medical diagnosis. Seek medical care if the wound worsens, you develop a fever, or drainage is heavy.";
"傷口：%@\n位置：%@\n\n請確認本次拍攝的是這一處傷口，再存入紀錄。" = "Wound: %@\nLocation: %@\n\nConfirm that this photo is of this wound before saving.";
"新增傷口" = "New wound";
"目前能提供的精確度" = "Current accuracy limitations";
"傷口表面積是估算值，供個人紀錄與參照。目前尚未完成足以確認真實拍攝誤差範圍的驗證，因此不能承諾固定的百分比精確度。" = "Wound surface area is an estimate for personal records and reference. Validation is not yet sufficient to establish the error range in real captures, so no fixed percentage accuracy can be promised.";
"顯示到小數點後兩位，不代表精確到 0.01 cm²。小幅數值變化可能來自拍攝或圈選差異，不一定是傷口真的改變。" = "Two decimal places do not mean accuracy to 0.01 cm². Small changes may come from capture or outline differences rather than a change in the wound.";
"已通過模擬資料的計算測試，但這不代表真實傷口、所有手機或所有拍攝情況都有相同精確度。" = "Calculation tests using simulated data have passed. This does not establish the same accuracy for real wounds, every phone or every capture condition.";
"哪些情況會影響結果" = "What affects the result";
"拍攝過近或過遠、角度傾斜、晃動、光線不足、濕亮反光、遮擋與圈選不準確，都可能造成誤差。小於 1 cm² 的傷口相對誤差可能更大。" = "Capturing too close or too far away, tilt, motion, poor lighting, wet reflective surfaces, obstructions and inaccurate outlines can cause errors. Relative error may be greater for wounds smaller than 1 cm².";
"建議正對傷口、距離約 25–40 公分並保持光線均勻。儲存前請放大查看邊界，必要時使用「修正圈選」。通過品質檢查仍不代表數值完全準確。" = "Face the wound directly from about 25–40 cm away with even lighting. Zoom in to check the boundary before saving and use Edit outline if needed. Passing quality checks does not guarantee an accurate value.";
"App 估計傾角超過 25° 時會提醒誤差可能增加；深度品質足夠時仍保留參考數值。25° 是操作提醒門檻，不是精確度保證；比較紀錄時應盡量正對拍攝。" = "The app warns that error may increase when estimated tilt exceeds 25°. Reference values remain available when depth quality is sufficient. The 25° threshold is a capture reminder, not an accuracy guarantee. Aim directly at the wound when comparing records.";
"拍攝螢幕或紙本上的傷口圖片時，量到的是顯示畫面上的範圍與表面，不能代表原傷口的實際大小、深度或形狀。" = "A photo of a wound shown on a screen or paper measures that displayed region and surface. It does not represent the original wound's actual size, depth or shape.";
"如何比較紀錄" = "Comparing records";
"只比較同一處傷口，盡量維持相同拍攝距離、角度、光線與圈選標準。圖表依拍攝時間排列，數值變化不能單獨判斷癒合或治療成效。" = "Compare only the same wound, keeping distance, angle, lighting and outline criteria as consistent as possible. Charts follow capture time. Numerical changes alone cannot determine healing or treatment effectiveness.";
"本 App 免貼紙。主要數值是 LiDAR 深度圖計算的表面積；另一個數值是朝相機方向的投影估算，兩者不能互換，也不能當成醫療版的貼紙校正面積。舊紀錄不自動改算，新舊來源分開比較。" = "This app does not require a sticker. The main value is surface area calculated from LiDAR depth; the other value is a projection toward the camera. They are not interchangeable and are not the medical app's sticker-calibrated area. Old records are not recalculated; different sources are compared separately.";
"通過方向、尺寸及深度覆蓋檢查，只表示資料具備計算條件，並不保證深度與照片在每一處都精確對齊。" = "Passing orientation, dimension and depth-coverage checks only establishes the conditions for calculation. It does not guarantee exact depth-to-photo alignment everywhere.";
"容積與最深值的限制" = "Volume and maximum-depth limitations";
"已知模型的實測顯示，小高低差可能被嚴重低估，且深度資料完整時也可能發生。容積與最深值只保留為研究參考，不能用來判定沒有凹陷、完整空腔體積或替代探針量測。" = "Tests on known models show that small height differences can be severely underestimated even with complete depth data. Volume and maximum depth are retained only as research references. They cannot establish that no depression exists, measure a complete cavity or replace probe measurement.";
"看不到的底部、側壁、潛行與隧道無法確認；彎曲部位、周邊皮膚不平、反光與輪廓誤差都可能影響結果。請勿用這些數字自行判斷傷口嚴重程度或決定治療。" = "Unseen bottoms, side walls, undermining and tunnels cannot be verified. Curvature, uneven surrounding skin, reflections and outline errors can affect results. Do not use these numbers to judge wound severity or choose treatment yourself.";
"使用範圍" = "Intended use";
"本 App 提供個人紀錄參考，不提供醫療診斷。若傷口惡化、發燒或大量滲液，請尋求醫療協助。" = "This app provides a reference for personal records, not a medical diagnosis. Seek medical care if the wound worsens, you develop a fever, or drainage is heavy.";
"辨識工作已保存在手機，尚未確認雲端完成。" = "The recognition task is saved on this phone. Cloud completion has not been confirmed.";
"正在核對原辨識工作；尚未確認完成，不會另建一筆重複辨識。" = "Checking the original recognition task. Completion is not confirmed; no duplicate task will be created.";
"今日辨識額度已用完或已有工作待確認；保留原照片，待額度可用後核對。" = "Today’s recognition allowance is used or a task is awaiting confirmation. Keep the original photo and check again when allowance is available.";
"服務忙碌，稍後核對原工作；不需重新拍攝。" = "The service is busy. Check the original task later; there is no need to retake the photo.";
"連線或裝置驗證尚未完成；下次先查原工作，不會直接重傳照片。" = "Connection or device verification is not complete. The next attempt will check the original task before sending the photo again.";
"雲端結果查詢期限已過；本機資料保留，需核對後再處理。" = "The cloud result lookup period has expired. Local data is retained; check the status before proceeding.";
"本次影像未通過檢查；未執行辨識，原資料保留。" = "This image did not pass validation. Recognition was not run; the original data is retained.";
"預留已逾時，尚未執行辨識。原照片保留；按「重新送出」後將重新檢查額度。" = "The reservation expired before recognition ran. The original photo is retained. Tapping “Submit again” will check the allowance again.";
"原工作已取消，但原因尚未確認；資料保留，請先核對，不會自動重送。" = "The original task was cancelled, but the reason is unconfirmed. Data is retained. Check the status first; it will not be resubmitted automatically.";
"服務回覆或資料不一致，已停止傳送；請保留原紀錄待核對。" = "The service response or data is inconsistent, so sending has stopped. Keep the original record for review.";
